    {
      "id": "weekly_rent_instructions",
      "type": "text_block",
      "label": "Please note the following tenancy requirements:\nTwo (2) weeks’ rent is payable in advance prior to move-in.\nA bond equivalent to four (4) weeks’ rent is required.\nWiFi is included in the weekly rent.\nUtilities are not included in the weekly rent and will be shared separately between housemates. This includes power, water and gas.\nPRICE GUARANTEE – For any fixed-term lease agreement renewal, the agreed rental amount will remain fixed for the duration of the renewed lease, subject to the terms of the Agreement.",
