    },
    {
      "id": "tenancy_reference",
      "endpoint_key": "tenancy_reference",
      "label": "Current/Previous Tenancy Details\nPlease provide your most recent rental history where possible, including the name and contact details of your property manager or owner. Please provide their phone number and email address, if available, so we can contact them for a rental reference. If we’re unable to reach them by phone, we may contact them via email instead.",
