      "label": "Employer Details\nPlease provide details of your current employer, including the business name, name of your employment referee, and contact details (e.g. phone number and/or email address). If not applicable, please enter N/A.",
      "type": "textarea",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "other_reference",
      "endpoint_key": "other_reference",
      "label": "Other Reference\nPlease provide details of an additional reference (e.g. personal, professional, or character reference), including their full name and contact details (e.g. phone number and/or email address). We may contact your referee to obtain a reference. If you do not have an additional reference, please enter N/A.",
